 "steps": [
  {
   "isSection": false,
   "order": 0,
   "step": "1. Heat the oven to 450\u00baF.",
   "uuid": "22D8E94F-0095-4780-B9B6-563626DAB694"
  },
  {
   "isSection": false,
   "order": 1,
   "step": "2. In a large bowl, whisk together the harissa, 1\u00bc teaspoons of the salt, pepper, 1.5 tsp cumin, and 4 tablespoons of the oil. Add the cauliflower and potatoes and toss to combine. 3. In a medium bowl, mix together the leeks, lemon zest, the remaining \u00bc teaspoon salt, and the remaining 1\u00bd tablespoons oil.",
   "uuid": "AE4869B6-0956-4A2C-8D14-22BB1635B06C"
  },
  {
   "isSection": false,
   "order": 2,
   "step": "4. On a large rimmed sheet pan, arrange the cauliflower and potatoes in a single layer. Roast for 20 minutes.",
   "uuid": "5F6A3F87-7749-4B3D-8C6C-1B1E48E4CF1F"
  },
  {
   "isSection": false,
   "order": 3,
   "step": "Stir the vegetables and scatter the leeks over them.",
   "uuid": "780FACC9-A5CB-40AE-9165-F5A13512D89F"
  },
  {
   "isSection": false,
   "order": 4,
   "step": "5. Reduce the oven temperature to 425\u00baF. Continue to roast until the potatoes are cooked through and everything is golden and slightly crisped, 15 to 20 minutes longer.",
   "uuid": "06933170-9BCC-4C2F-B536-2CE8508A2621"
  },
  {
   "isSection": false,
   "order": 5,
   "step": "6. While the veggies cook, place the yogurt in a small bowl. Grate or use a press to press the garlic into the yogurt and season with a pinch each of salt and pepper. Stir well.",
   "uuid": "4C796F4A-8416-41E6-A059-BA84F24B2DF1"
  },
  {
   "isSection": false,
   "order": 6,
   "step": "7. Spoon the yogurt sauce over the vegetables on the sheet pan. Then scatter the herbs and almonds over everything. Drizzle with oil and a few squeezes from a lemon wedge or two and serve at once, with remaining lemon wedges on the side.",
   "uuid": "D5A00DCA-3C26-420B-ACBA-9AF946C78851"
  }
 ],
 "serves": 3,
 "webLink": "https://www.splendidtable.org/story/2022/10/18/roasted-cauliflower-and-potatoes-with-harissa-yogurt-and-toasted-almonds",
 "name": "Roasted Cauliflower And Potatoes With Harissa, Yogurt, And Toasted Almonds  The Splendid Table"
}